# Vyzin API — exemplos de requisições

Use a extensão **REST Client** (VS Code/Cursor) e clique em **Send Request**.

**Backend:** `npm run start:dev:local` (emuladores) ou `npm run start:dev` (Firebase real) — porta **3000**.

**Antes:** rode `npm run seed:local` (emuladores) ou `npm run seed` (Firebase real).

---

## Autenticação

A API aceita duas formas:

1. **Cookie `vyzin_session`** (fluxo normal da SPA) — definido após `POST /auth/login`
2. **Bearer token** — `Authorization: Bearer <Firebase ID token>` (integrações / debug)

> REST Client: após login, algumas versões persistem cookies automaticamente entre requests do mesmo arquivo. Se não persistir, use Bearer ou copie o cookie manualmente.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

###############################################################################
# AUTH
###############################################################################

### Healthcheck (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Login — retorna user + profile e seta cookie vyzin_session
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vyzin.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Dados do usuário logado (cookie ou Bearer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Logout — limpa cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Catálogo de funções (requer profiles:read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/functions

###############################################################################
# PERFIS (/profiles)
###############################################################################

### Listar perfis
GET {{baseUrl}}/profiles

### Criar perfil
POST {{baseUrl}}/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zelador",
  "description": "Acesso operacional",
  "functions": ["reservations:read", "visitors:read", "announcements:read"]
}

### Atualizar perfil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profiles/COLE_O_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zelador",
  "description": "Acesso operacional atualizado",
  "functions": ["reservations:read", "visitors:read", "visitors:workflow", "announcements:read"]
}

### Excluir perfil
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/profiles/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

###############################################################################
# USUÁRIOS (/users)
###############################################################################

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Criar usuario (provisiona Firebase Auth + Firestore)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria@vyzin.com",
  "password": "maria123",
  "cpf": "333.333.333-33",
  "phone": "(61) 93333-3333",
  "apartment": "101",
  "block": "A",
  "profileId": "resident"
}

### Atualizar usuario
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/COLE_O_UID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "cpf": "333.333.333-33",
  "phone": "(61) 93333-3333",
  "apartment": "102",
  "block": "A",
  "profileId": "resident"
}

### Excluir usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/COLE_O_UID_AQUI

###############################################################################
# RESERVAS (/reservations)
###############################################################################

### Listar espacos e duracao de blocos
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/spaces

### Horarios disponiveis de um espaco em uma data
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/available-slots?space=Sal%C3%A3o%20de%20Festas&date=2026-07-20

### Listar / filtrar reservas
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=confirmed&date=2026-07-20&search=salao

### Criar reserva (data nao pode ser passada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "space": "Salao de Festas",
  "date": "2026-07-20",
  "startTime": "18:00",
  "endTime": "23:00",
  "notes": "Aniversario do apto 302",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "linkedVisitorIds": []
}

### Buscar reserva
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

### Atualizar reserva
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reservations/COLE_O_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "space": "Salao de Festas",
  "date": "2026-07-20",
  "startTime": "19:00",
  "endTime": "23:30",
  "notes": "Horario ajustado",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "linkedVisitorIds": []
}

### Excluir reserva
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

### Vincular visitante a reserva (requer visitors:manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/COLE_O_ID_RESERVA/visitors/COLE_O_ID_VISITANTE

### Desvincular visitante da reserva
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/COLE_O_ID_RESERVA/visitors/COLE_O_ID_VISITANTE

###############################################################################
# VISITANTES (/visitors)
###############################################################################

### Listar / filtrar
GET {{baseUrl}}/visitors?status=waiting&search=ana

### Criar visitante (data/horario nao podem ser passados)
POST {{baseUrl}}/visitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joao da Silva",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-00",
  "phone": "(61) 99999-0000",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "purpose": "Visita ao apto 101",
  "date": "2026-07-15",
  "time": "14:30",
  "notes": "Entregador",
  "visitType": "apartment"
}

### Workflow de status (autorizar/negar/saida) — requer visitors:workflow
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/visitors/COLE_O_ID_AQUI/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "authorized"
}

### Excluir visitante
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/visitors/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

###############################################################################
# PRÉ-AUTORIZADOS (/pre-authorizations)
###############################################################################

### Listar pre-autorizados (morador ve apenas os proprios)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pre-authorizations

### Criar pre-autorizado
POST {{baseUrl}}/pre-authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Diarista",
  "cpf": "111.222.333-44",
  "phone": "(61) 98888-7777",
  "type": "cleaner",
  "notes": "Toda terca e quinta"
}

### Atualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pre-authorizations/COLE_O_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Diarista",
  "cpf": "111.222.333-44",
  "phone": "(61) 98888-7777",
  "type": "cleaner",
  "notes": "Horario atualizado"
}

### Excluir
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pre-authorizations/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

###############################################################################
# MURAL (/announcements)
###############################################################################

### Listar / filtrar
GET {{baseUrl}}/announcements?category=maintenance

### Criar aviso
POST {{baseUrl}}/announcements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manutencao da piscina",
  "content": "A piscina ficara fechada na proxima segunda para limpeza.",
  "category": "maintenance",
  "isPinned": true,
  "isImportant": false
}

### Atualizar aviso
PUT {{baseUrl}}/announcements/COLE_O_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manutencao da piscina (reagendada)",
  "content": "Nova data: terca-feira.",
  "category": "maintenance",
  "isPinned": false,
  "isImportant": true
}

### Excluir aviso
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/announcements/COLE_O_ID_AQUI

###############################################################################
# INFORMAÇÕES DO CONDOMÍNIO (/information)
###############################################################################

### Obter informacoes (documento condoInformation/default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/information

### Atualizar informacoes (requer information:edit)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/information
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Residencial Vyzin",
  "address": {
    "street": "Rua das Flores, 100",
    "neighborhood": "Centro",
    "city": "Brasilia",
    "state": "DF",
    "zipCode": "70000-000"
  },
  "contacts": [
    { "label": "Portaria", "phone": "(61) 3333-0000" }
  ],
  "rules": ["Silencio apos 22h", "Uso de mascara na piscina"],
  "documents": []
}

###############################################################################
# RELATÓRIOS (/reports)
###############################################################################

### Relatorio operacional (joins reservas + visitantes + usuarios + perfis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/operational?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Relatorio com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/operational?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-30&reservationStatus=confirmed&space=Churrasqueira%202&search=maria
